Zero point energy                ...      0.10904151 Eh      68.42 kcal/mol
Thermal vibrational correction   ...      0.01192762 Eh       7.48 kcal/mol
Thermal rotational correction    ...      0.00141627 Eh       0.89 kcal/mol
